oote und die Motorboote der Trainer.", "en": "The Toda Rowing Course was built for the 1964 Tokyo Olympics: a straight basin about 2.4 km long and 90 m wide next to the Arakawa river. Boathouses of universities, company and school crews line the north bank; on the right, the high Arakawa levee separates the basin from the river. The water belongs almost entirely to rowing boats and coaching launches."}, "highlights": [{"name": {"de": "Bootshäuser der Universitäten", "en": "University boathouses"}, "side": "links", "note": {"de": "am ganzen Nordufer", "en": "along the whole north bank"}}, {"name": {"de": "Arakawa-Damm", "en": "Arakawa levee"}, "side": "rechts"}, {"name": {"de": "Olympiastrecke 1964", "en": "1964 Olympic course"}, "side": "beide", "note": {"de": "ganze Strecke", "en": "whole course"}}], "bridges": ["Toda-Kōen-Ōhashi (Fussgängersteg)"], "minimap": {"image": "minimap.jpg", "bounds_xz": [-1300.6, -1280.3, 1309.4, 1329.7]}, "overview": {"image": "overview.jpg", "bounds_xz": [-3388.6, -3368.3, 3397.4, 3417.7]}, "traffic": {"vessels": ["motorboot"], "density": 0.6, "rower_lanes": [{"out_m": -9.0, "back_m": 22.0, "turn_out_m": -16.0, "turn_back_m": 28.0}, {"out_m": -18.0, "back_m": 31.0, "turn_out_m": -24.0, "turn_back_m": 36.0}, {"out_m": -27.0, "back_m": 40.0, "turn_out_m": -32.0, "turn_back_m": 44.0}], "vessel_lanes": [{"id": "p-277-1", "kind": "parallel", "min_dist_m": 277.0, "shore_m": 21.6, "points_xz": [[-740.8, 225.7], [302.9, 334.2]]}, {"id": "p-277-2", "kind": "parallel", "min_dist_m": 276.8, "shore_m": 20.6, "points_xz": [[1071.0, 414.0], [1498.8, 457.7]]}, {"id": "f-450-3", "kind": "far", "min_dist_m": 443.0, "shore_m": 35.1, "points_xz": [[-1485.0, 322.3], [-977.8, 375.0]]}], "rower_docks": [{"id": "d1", "name": "Steg", "kind": "pier", "lane": 2, "join_u": 210.0, "exit_u": 130.0, "enter_xz": [[-1158.5, -67.7], [-1114.4, -63.3], [-1073.6, -59.3], [-1036.0, -55.6], [-1001.7, -52.2], [-970.7, -49.1], [-942.9, -46.3], [-918.4, -43.9], [-897.1, -41.8